sec.p:
Regarding the controllable smart devices, we incorporated a set of real smart devices, each offering a structured interface for reading and updating the current state:
Lights—WiZ bulbs [31] (brightness, color warmth, power state);
AC—Sensibo-controlled air conditioners [32] (temperature, fan speed, mode, power);
Shutter—Switcher-controlled smart blinds [33] (open/close position);
Fridge—SmartThings refrigerator [34] (fridge/freezer temperatures).

To assess the flexibility of the SmartHouseOperator, experiments evaluate three interchangeable coordination engines:
CrewAI—structured, role-based teamwork;
LangGraph—graph-based agent workflows;
Agno Team—lightweight and modular muti-agents asynchronous coordination.
